    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An exceptionally well-presented three-bedroom mid-terraced residence, maintained to a high standard throughout. It is located in the popular Elm Gardens development, an exclusive scheme of just 12 homes in the highly sought-after village of Balla. Balla offers an  excellent range of amenities including  primary and secondary schools, an 18-hole golf course, woodland trails and scenic looped walks, together with  shops, and sporting facilities. This property is conveniently located within easy commuting distance of Claremorris and Castlebar, approximately  20 mins from Ireland West Airport Knock, and just 50 mins from Galway city. \r\n\r\nThe property is well- maintained and some of its features include tiled flooring in the entrance hallway,  fully fitted kitchen complete with appliances, fireplace in the sitting room,  timber flooring in all bedrooms, built-in wardrobes in two bedrooms, a fully tiled main  bathroom, ensuite and guest WC., hardwood double-glazed windows, oil-fired central heating, back garden with paving area, tarmacadam driveway providing ample off-street parking.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of Entrance Hallway, Living Room, Kitchen/Dining Room, Guest W.C, 3 Bedrooms, 1 Ensuite, 1 Bathroom.\r\n\r\nWith its convenient location, this property is a superb family home or investment property. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
