        "Content": "An exceptionally well-presented three bedroom mid-terraced residence. Maintained to a high standard throughout. Conveniently located in the centre of Balla village. Close to all amenities. Fully fitted kitchen complete with appliances. Fireplace in the sitting room. Timber flooring in all bedrooms, built-in wardrobe in two bedrooms. Fully tiled main bathroom, ensuite and guest WC., Hardwood double- glazed windows. Oil-fired central heating. Back garden with paving area. Tarmacadam driveway with ample parking."
